<title>USA: IPO FILING -- Vivid Technologies Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING -- Vivid Technologies Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		 Vivid Technologies Inc</p>
<p>Stock symbol			VVID.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $12-$14/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    2.0 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 2.0 million</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after ipo    8,792,370</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter		Lehman Brothers</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment     N/A</p>
<p>Business: The Woburn, Mass-based company is a developer, manufacturer and marketer of automated inspection systems which detect plastic and other explosives in airline baggage.</p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: For working capital and general corporate purposes. In addition, about $5.8 million of the net proceeds will be used to redeem certain non-convertible redeemable preferred stock. Financial Data in 000s year ended Sept 30:</p>
<p>				   1995		 1994</p>
<p>   - Revenue		 $14,437	    $13,801</p>
<p>   - Net Income	     $2,014	     $2,810</p>
